<component #example-server.dotnet_example_server { kind = "component" } [
  <desc ?01KYFRW15KZFBKA2JXBCDJDX22>
  私有示例应用：把浏览器 HTTP 请求适配为本体、Datalog、schema 与治理能力调用，不承载核心领域事实。
  </?01KYFRW15KZFBKA2JXBCDJDX22>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  sealed class ExampleServerState { DemoRunFactory demoRuns; StatefulDomain schema; StatefulDomain governance; StatefulDomain integrity; }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  HTTP JSON requests from example-browser
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  ExampleServerOptions { string[] AllowedOrigins }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  HTTP JSON DemoResponse | RunResponse | governance responses
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?flow>
  路由验证输入 → 选择隔离 state domain 或独立 demo database → 调用 Depa.Ontology → 映射浏览器 DTO → 返回 JSON。
  </?flow>
]>
